  - nodeId: op_1
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Pi\u0105tek. Declan otwiera drug\u0105 restauracj\u0119, nad Liffey, w nowym szklanym budynku z widokiem na d\u017Awigi. Na otwarciu p\xF3\u0142 miasta: deweloperzy, bankierzy, kto\u015B z telewizji."
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Look at them. Champagne at four hundred a bottle, and not one of them ever washed a pot.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Gavin jest szefem kuchni w nowym miejscu. Ma w\u0142asny n\xF3\u017C z Japonii i te same niebieskie plastry co wszyscy."
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Ko\u0142o p\xF3\u0142nocy deweloper w r\xF3\u017Cowej koszuli wchodzi do kuchni z plikiem banknot\xF3w."
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Your man just tipped the kitchen five hundred. Five hundred! Go way outta that. He's a gaff in Dalkey with a helicopter pad, they say.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Pi\u0119\u0107set euro na dwana\u015Bcie os\xF3b. Czterdzie\u015Bci dla mnie. Dwa lata temu tyle zarabia\u0142em przez ca\u0142y dzie\u0144."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - champagne
    - bottle
    - pot
    - tipped
    - five
    - hundred
    - helicopter
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_go_way
    - slang_gaff
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 40
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: ch3_helped_gavin
    branchNodeId: op_owed
    nextNodeId: op_offer
  - nodeId: op_owed
    lines:
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Kooba. You saved my hand and my lamb that night with the critic. I don't forget.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - saved
    - forget
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: op_offer
  - nodeId: op_offer
    lines:
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Come with me to the new place. Better money, glass walls, the whole city watching. What do you say?
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Szklane \u015Bciany. Wszyscy b\u0119d\u0105 widzie\u0107, jak pracujemy. Declan m\xF3wi, \u017Ce w takich kuchniach kucharze zaczynaj\u0105 gotowa\u0107 dla widowni, a nie dla go\u015Bci."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - better
    - walls
    - watching
    - say
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: "Id\u0119 z Gavinem do nowego miejsca."
      targetNodeId: op_go
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "Zostaj\u0119 u Declana."
      targetNodeId: op_stay
      requiredFlag: 
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: op_go
    lines:
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Deadly. Monday. Bring your plasters.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Declan \u015Bciska mi r\u0119k\u0119 tak, jak \u015Bciska si\u0119 r\u0119k\u0119 synowi, kt\xF3ry wyje\u017Cd\u017Ca. Mocno i kr\xF3tko."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch4_with_gavin
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 5
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: op_stay
    lines:
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Loyal. Declan's lucky. ...Don't tell him I said that.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Zostaj\u0119 tam, gdzie przyj\u0119li mnie z dwudziestoma euro w kieszeni. Mo\u017Ce to sentyment. Mo\u017Ce rozs\u0105dek. W Dublinie czasem to jedno i to samo."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - loyal
    - lucky
